{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, approach, take, check properties and do specific task. Scan area or move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextZone    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />\"",
